# plain = {}; beside = { held }; odd = { given }; odd.__defineGetter__("late", somethingNoTableLists); Object.values(plain); Object.values(beside); Object.values(odd)
# More objects in the hub of what has its values listed than the analysis tells apart: it tells one apart here, the plain object, which has the first layout. The two others come together.
# Object.values runs the getters of its operand with the operand as `this`. The getter nobody knows lies on the odd object, so that one is handed to it and escapes with what it holds.
# That says nothing about the object that came together with it: each is asked by itself whether such a getter lies on it. It stays in the program, and nobody enters what it holds.
# converted-objects-past-those-told-apart-are-handed-to-what-each-of-them-finds.ir has the same for a method that is found under a name.
# OPTIONS: limit=MaxValueFlowMembersToldApart:1
# LOSS: MaxValueFlowMembersToldApart
# RUN: valueflow-solve unreached
# CHECK: unreached f1
# CHECK-NOT: unreached f2
# RUN(ESCAPED): valueflow-why escaped=f1 escaped=f2
# ESCAPED: escaped=f1
# ESCAPED-NEXT: not held
# ESCAPED: escaped=f2
# ESCAPED-NEXT: n0 escaped

module m0 path="main.js" displayPath="main.js" body=f0
entry module=m0
layout L0 name="Plain"
layout L1 name="Beside" fields=[{key="held" declared={type=anything} flags=[IsRequired]}]
layout L2 name="Odd" fields=[{key="given" declared={type=anything} flags=[IsRequired]}]
function f0 name="main" kind=Module results=[{type=anything}] {
    v0 = NewObject layout=L0 fields=[]
    v1 = NewClosure function=f1
    v2 = NewObject -, v1 layout=L1 fields=[0]
    v3 = Builtin builtin=GlobalThis
    v4 = PropGet v3 key="somethingThatNoTableLists" [isFreeName]
    v5 = NewClosure function=f2
    v6 = NewObject -, v5 layout=L2 fields=[0]
    v7 = Builtin builtin=ObjectPrototype__defineGetter__
    v8 = String string="late"
    v9 = Call v7, v6, v8, v4
    v10 = Builtin builtin=ObjectValues
    v11 = Call v10, -, v0
    v12 = Call v10, -, v2
    v13 = Call v10, -, v6
    Return
}
function f1 name="held" kind=Arrow results=[{type=anything}] {
    Return
}
function f2 name="given" kind=Arrow results=[{type=anything}] {
    Return
}
